WEBVTT

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.346
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Have you been</b> to that new Mexican restaurant?

00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:08.132
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>I have</b>.

00:00:08.378 --> 00:00:09.862
<v><b>A:</b></v> When <b>did you go</b> there?

00:00:10.116 --> 00:00:11.909
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>I went</b> last weekend.

00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:13.755
<v><b>A:</b></v> Who <b>did you go</b> with?

00:00:14.081 --> 00:00:16.440
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>I went</b> with some people from work.